   to them; each remains under its own license or terms:

   a. Datasets: UrbanScene3D, and any other dataset that ANet-Drone4D can
      download, read or convert, together with anything built from their
      content, such as World Packages, terrain and semantic rasters,
      flight paths and recordings. UrbanScene3D is made available by its
      authors for non-commercial use only, and neither the dataset nor an
      altered version of it may be redistributed. The ANet-Drone4D
      repository contains neither UrbanScene3D data nor World Packages
      built from it. Tools such as `make fetch-data` and `worldpkg` only
      fetch or convert data that you obtain yourself, under the dataset's
      own terms, which you must accept before you download or use it.
      Condition 1 permits commercial use of ANet-Drone4D; it does not
      permit commercial use of UrbanScene3D or of anything derived from
      it.
   b. Third-party software, code and assets that ANet-Drone4D includes or
      adapts, as listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md (for example the
      shadcn/ui component sources, the Transitions.dev motion tokens and
      the P600 airframe model derived from Prometheus). Where the terms of
      such a component are more restrictive than this License, including
      a non-commercial license, those terms apply to that component.
   c. Reference repositories that the ANet-Drone4D documentation cites or
      studies, which are not part of the ANet-Drone4D repository, and the
      third-party dependencies that ANet-Drone4D installs from package
      registries such as npm and PyPI.
   d. Names, logos and trademarks of third parties, which ANet-Drone4D
      uses only to identify their projects, products and datasets.

